{
  "id": 499792264,
  "iid": 25530,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "AFP: Add support for AFP 2.x ProDOS Info Block",
  "description": "Add support for dissecting the AFP 2.x ProDOS Info block as documented in \"Inside AppleTalk\" page 13-18.\n\nDue to Apple later reusing this flag for the UTF-8 filename offset, employ some heuristics to properly decode these packets.\n\nIn real world packet monitoring, a UTF8 offset will never be zero, nor will it exceed 255 bytes. In those cases it is a ProDOS Info block being returned by an AFP 2.x client.\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
