      "title": "AFP: Add support for AFP 2.x ProDOS Info Block",
      "message": "AFP: Add support for AFP 2.x ProDOS Info Block\n\nAdd support for dissecting the AFP 2.x ProDOS Info block as documented in \"Inside AppleTalk\"\n\nDue to Apple later reusing this flag for the UTF-8 filename offset, employ some heuristics to properly decode these packets.\n\nIn real world packet monitoring, a UTF8 offset will never be zero, nor will it exceed 255 bytes. In those cases it is a ProDOS Info block being returned by an AFP 2.x client.\n\nAI-Assisted: no\n",
      "author_name": "NJRoadfan",
      "author_email": "NJRoadfan@users.noreply.github.com",
      "authored_date": "2026-06-24T23:08:12.000-04:00",
